{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693550/extras/SCENE0.gif?t=1747810534\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693550/extras/SCENE2-E.png?t=1747810534\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693550/extras/SCENE1.gif?t=1747810534\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693550/extras/SCENE4-E.png?t=1747810534\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693550/extras/BATTLE-30.gif?t=1747810534\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693550/extras/SCENE6-E.png?t=1747810534\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693550/extras/OutSide.gif?t=1747810534\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693550/extras/SCENE8-E.png?t=1747810534\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>FrostBound</strong></i> is a roguelike tower defense card game set in an endless, frozen winter. TTake command as you build your garrison, explore the snowy wilderness, gather vital resources, and repel relentless waves of enemies. Create defenses you never thought before from a vast card pool of over 500 cards, forging unprecedented battlefield synergies to turn the tide of battle, preserve the flame of civilization, and put an end to this endless winter.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>BRAND NEW GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The enemy is advancing towards us. We must defend our fortress at all costs and not let the enemy pass the leftmost line of defense!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can choose to attack or deploy troops in each round. It should be noted that the severe cold environment will cause the soldiers to withdraw after one round. Only solid buildings and powerful units can stand on the battlefield and continue to fight.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>DIFFERENT EXPERIENCE EACH ROUND</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A huge mixed card pool of <strong>more than 500 cards</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4 major schools with their own characteristics, combined together to exert unexpected abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique elite card mechanism, experience the fun of growth in every battle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">10 powerful starting heroes, each with his own unique skills to help you fight</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>More than 100 buildings</strong>, bringing overall improvement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>More than 80 enemies</strong>, can you resist the oppressive disaster</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3693550?t=1747810534","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693550/5cb897718a78cfd55cda60f651120ea38938a157/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747810534","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693550/f174a06cfca61454d7e78f896a10c65e65897305/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747810534","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693550/f174a06cfca61454d7e78f896a10c65e65897305/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747810534","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb